{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>佳存成人50+鈣片60粒裝（Caltrate Adult 50+）邊度買平？新假期整理屈臣氏、萬寧、HKTVmall、Market Place及龍豐共5間零售商的網店報價。以同款單盒標價計，最低與次低相差HK$33，約18%。</p>\n<h2>佳存成人50+鈣片60粒裝各網店報價</h2>\n<table>\n<thead></thead>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>零售商</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單盒標價</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單盒總額</strong></th>\n<th><strong>計價條件</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>最低已核實｜龍豐</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$152</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$152</strong></td>\n<td><strong>單盒標價</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HKTVmall</td>\n<td>HK$185</td>\n<td>HK$185</td>\n<td>單盒標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>萬寧</td>\n<td>HK$239.9</td>\n<td>HK$239.9</td>\n<td>單盒標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>屈臣氏</td>\n<td>HK$239.9</td>\n<td>HK$239.9</td>\n<td>單盒標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Market Place</td>\n<td>HK$247</td>\n<td>HK$247</td>\n<td>單盒標價</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>佳存成人50+鈣片60粒裝單盒價錢點計？</h2>\n<p>買一盒佳存成人50+鈣片60粒裝，龍豐的同款網上標價為HK$152，較表列次低標價HK$185少HK$33。佳存成人50+鈣片60粒裝這個價差以單盒商品標價比較。若打算買多件，宜另計商戶的購買條件及結帳價。</p>\n<p>以上為2026年11月14日商戶網上報價，未計運費，價格、優惠及供應以商戶為準。網店來源：<a href=\"https://www.watsons.com.hk/zh-hk/%E4%BD%B3%E5%AD%98-%E4%BD%B3%E5%AD%98%E6%88%90%E4%BA%BA50-%E9%88%A3%E7%89%87-60%E7%B2%92%E8%A3%9D/p/BP_821426\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">屈臣氏</a><a href=\"https://www.mannings.com.hk/zh-hant/caltrate-adult-50-calcium-vitamin-d3-plus-minerals-60pcs/p/469908\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬寧</a><a href=\"https://www.hktvmall.com/hktv/zh/main/%E5%8D%9A%E6%9D%B1%E8%97%A5%E5%A6%9D/s/B1019002/%E8%AD%B7%E7%90%86%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5/%E8%AD%B7%E7%90%86%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5/%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5%E7%94%A2%E5%93%81/%E5%85%8D%E7%96%AB%E7%B3%BB%E7%B5%B1/%E4%BD%B3%E5%AD%98-Caltrate%E4%BD%B3%E5%AD%98%E6%88%90%E4%BA%BA50%E9%88%A3%E7%89%87-60%E7%89%87/p/B1019002_S_san-386\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">HKTVmall</a><a href=\"https://www.marketplacehk.com/zh-hant/wellcome/p/%E4%BD%B3%E5%AD%98%E6%88%90%E4%BA%BA50%2B%E9%88%A3%E7%89%87%20%2060PC/i/101346173.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Market Place</a><a href=\"https://eshop.lungfung.hk/product/mdn260033/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">龍豐</a></p>\n<p>這款配方含鈣及維他命D。維他命D有助身體吸收鈣質，兩者都有助維持骨骼健康。如對成分或服用有疑問，建議先諮詢醫生或其他合資格的醫護專業人士。<a href=\"https://ods.od.nih.gov/factsheets/VitaminD-Consumer/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIH ODS：維他命D</a></p>\n<p>計算方法：（較高標價－較低標價）÷較高標價×100%。本次以（HK$185－HK$152）÷HK$185×100%計，約18%。上述比例未計運費及額外活動，亦不代表全港最低價、歷史低價或不同包裝版本的配方已完全核實一致。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179463491276876552_5195557016af7f4a12e408.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"佳存成人50+鈣片60粒裝格價：龍豐 HK$152，單盒約平18%\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179463491276876552_5195557016af7f4a12e408.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>點樣先可以用圖中價格買到佳存成人50+鈣片60粒裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>以2026年11月14日網上報價，龍豐的單盒商品總額為HK$152。條件為單盒標價，未計運費。</p>\n<p>今次格價比較哪一款包裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>比較對象是成人50+配方60粒裝。一般成人鈣片及其他粒數不在表內。</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T06:00:30.435822+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":811,"images":1,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T05:41:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T08:47:33.279319+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T05:53:56.630249+00:00","content_hash":"26647c0e7b210a47734f4b181b814a810bf9a714c2d64a612b5a1fbc0f6fb075","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}